// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1` (design/19-cases.md).
run 1: Readings { visibility: ByMember, binding_path: AsStated, deferral: Recording }, every order
outcome 1
  refused
  value `&1`: &u16
  value `&x`: &u16
  value `&y`: &u16
  value `&y 2`: &u16
  value 1u16: u16
  value ?a: u16
  value ?b: u16
  value R1: u16
  value R2: u16
  value X: u16
  value Y: u16
  value `probe(x)`: ()
  decision `&1`: lend & place
  decision `&x`: lend & place
  decision `&y`: lend & place
  decision `&y 2`: lend & place
  decision probe: probe#1
  decision `x + y`: core::add#1
  decision `y + 1`: core::add#1
  partition {?a, X}
  check `&1 ~> y + 1.Param(1)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `&x ~> x + y.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `&y 2 ~> y + 1.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `&y ~> x + y.Param(1)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `1u16 <= Y`: Ok(Identity)
  check `?a <= X`: Ok(Identity)
  check `R1 <= X`: Ok(Identity)
  check `R2 <= Y`: Ok(Identity)
  check `X ~> probe.Param(0)`: Err(None)
  check `probe.Result <= probe(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `x + y.Result <= R1`: Ok(Identity)
  check `y + 1.Result <= R2`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: [completeness probe]
